                                        "entry_id": "aa1f8842-1987-35a7-bf29-aff72c557076",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An affix that forms agent nouns."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "223f5bd9-ff85-44d6-9339-cc6a8c200465",
                                                "sense_id": "63a802d5-9dfd-327e-819e-4c857f40845d",
                                                "text": "Semantically, a majority of agentials refer to avian vocalization. Examples are: screamer, whistler, warbler, trumpeter, and the suffixless chat."
